out your own knowledge as a player.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2435240/extras/1094e109de21853bc95763ecffc53b72.avif?t=1723240519\" /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A world of stories</h2>The world is generated anew for every game, and provides endless opportunity for exploration. The areas are distinct and varied, and each one has a small story of its own. From abandoned farms to bewitched woods - intriguing, even if unwelcoming.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2435240/extras/2976838d2dc793944476fd81f7518ba1.poster.avif?t=1723240519\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2435240/extras/2976838d2dc793944476fd81f7518ba1.webm?t=1723240519\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2435240/extras/2976838d2dc793944476fd81f7518ba1.mp4?t=1723240519\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >First ever ASMR roguelike</h2>Rains and storms, sounds of wildlife, crackling of the fireplace, and flickering torches, with chill ambient music. All to immerse you into the vivid world, both visually and audially.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2435240/extras/0eb4ef086efddd18696cff51ec7f8ce9.poster.avif?t=1723240519\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2435240/extras/0eb4ef086efddd18696cff51ec7f8ce9.webm?t=1723240519\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2435240/extras/0eb4ef086efddd18696cff51ec7f8ce9.mp4?t=1723240519\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Be creati